# AGENTS.md (example)

Copy into your repo and adapt for your team.

```sh
export PATH="$HOME/agentsys/bin:$PATH"
export AGENTSYS_ACTOR="cursor:yourname:work"
agentsys status
agentsys resume <task>
```

Rules:

- Use `agent:<harness>:<role>` for automated work; use `human:<name>` only from an interactive shell.
- Do not merge or approve without `human:` identity.
- Run `agentsys verify-log` before trusting a shared store.
